ambulance,noun,xe cứu thương,/ˈæmbjələns/,"a vehicle with special equipment, used for taking sick or injured people to a hospital",Call an ambulance!,Gọi xe cứu thương!,b2,b2
amend,verb,sửa đổi,/əˈmend/,"to change a law, document, statement, etc. slightly in order to correct a mistake or to improve it",He asked to see the amended version.,He asked to see the amended version.,c1,c1
amendment,noun,sửa đổi,/əˈmendmənt/,a small change or improvement that is made to a document or proposed new law; the process of changing a document or proposed new law,to introduce/propose/table an amendment (= to suggest it),giới thiệu/đề xuất/bàn ra một sửa đổi (= đề xuất nó),c1,c1
amid,preposition,ở giữa,/əˈmɪd/,"in the middle of or during something, especially something that causes excitement or fear",He finished his speech amid tremendous applause.,Anh ấy kết thúc bài phát biểu của mình trong tiếng vỗ tay vang dội.,c1,c1
amusing,adjective,thú vị,/əˈmjuːzɪŋ/,funny and giving pleasure,an amusing story/game/incident,một câu chuyện/trò chơi/sự cố thú vị,b2,b2
analogy,noun,sự so sánh tương tự,/əˈnælədʒi/,a comparison of one thing with another thing that has similar features; a feature that is similar,"analogy (between A and B), The teacher drew an analogy between the human heart and a pump.","Tương tự (giữa A và B), Giáo viên vẽ tương tự giữa trái tim con người và một cái bơm.",c1,c1
analyst,noun,nhà phân tích,/ˈænəlɪst/,a person whose job involves examining facts or materials in order to give an opinion on them,a political/financial analyst,một nhà phân tích chính trị/tài chính,b2,b2
ancestor,noun,tổ tiên,/ˈænsestə(r)/,a person in your family who lived a long time ago,His ancestors had come to America from Ireland.,Tổ tiên của anh ấy đến Mỹ từ Ireland.,b2,b2
anchor,noun,mỏ neo,/ˈæŋkə(r)/,a heavy metal object that is attached to a rope or chain and dropped over the side of a ship or boat to keep it in one place,to drop anchor,thả neo,c1,c1
angel,noun,thiên thần,/ˈeɪndʒl/,"a spirit who is believed to be a servant of God, and is sent by God to deliver a message or perform a task. Angels are often shown dressed in white, with wings.",a host of angels,một loạt các thiên thần,c1,c1
animation,noun,hoạt hình,/ˌænɪˈmeɪʃn/,"the process of making films, videos and computer games in which drawings, models or images of people and animals seem to move",computer/cartoon animation,hoạt hình máy tính/hoạt hình,b2,b2
annually,adverb,hàng năm,/ˈænjuəli/,once a year,The exhibition is held annually.,Triển lãm được tổ chức hàng năm.,b2,b2
