warehouse,noun,kho hàng,/ˈweəhaʊs/,"a building where large quantities of goods are stored, especially before they are sent to shops to be sold",Police are investigating a fire at a furniture warehouse.,Cảnh sát đang điều tra vụ cháy tại kho đồ nội thất.,c1,c1
warfare,noun,chiến tranh,/ˈwɔːfeə(r)/,"the activity of fighting a war, especially using particular weapons or methods",air/naval/guerrilla warfare,chiến tranh trên không/hải quân/du kích,c1,c1
warming,noun,sự ấm lên,/ˈwɔːmɪŋ/,"the process of making something, or of becoming, warm or warmer",atmospheric warming,sự nóng lên của khí quyển,b2,b2
warrant,noun,lệnh khám xét,/ˈwɒrənt/,a legal document that is signed by a judge and gives the police authority to do something,an arrest warrant,lệnh bắt giữ,c1,c1
warrant,verb,lệnh khám xét,/ˈwɒrənt/,to make something necessary or appropriate in a particular situation,"warrant something, Further investigation is clearly warranted.","đảm bảo điều gì đó, Cần phải điều tra thêm một cách rõ ràng.",c1,c1
warrior,noun,chiến binh,/ˈwɒriə(r)/,(especially in the past) a person who fights in a battle or war,a warrior nation (= whose people are skilled in fighting),một quốc gia chiến binh (= dân tộc có kỹ năng chiến đấu),c1,c1
weaken,verb,làm suy yếu,/ˈwiːkən/,to make somebody/something less strong or powerful; to become less strong or powerful,The team has been weakened by injury.,Đội bóng bị suy yếu do chấn thương.,c1,c1
weave,verb,dệt,/wiːv/,"to make cloth, a carpet, a basket, etc. by crossing threads or narrow pieces of material across, over and under each other by hand or on a machine called a loom","weave A from B, The baskets are woven from strips of willow.","dệt A từ B, Những chiếc giỏ được đan từ những dải liễu.",c1,c1
weed,noun,cỏ dại,/wiːd/,"a wild plant growing where it is not wanted, especially among crops or garden plants",The yard was overgrown with weeds.,Sân cỏ mọc um tùm.,c1,c1
weekly,adjective,hàng tuần,/ˈwiːkli/,"happening, done or published once a week or every week",weekly meetings,họp hàng tuần,b2,b2
